  "Easy Badge Creation and Customization ": "Einfache Erstellung und Anpassung von Abzeichen ",
  "Creating and customizing product badges is a breeze with our intuitive interface. You can effortlessly design badges that align with your brand’s aesthetics and marketing goals. Whether you want to emphasize a \"New Arrival,\" \"Best Seller,\" \"Limited Edition,\" or any other key attribute, our module allows you to tailor the text and imagery to perfectly match your promotional strategy. This flexibility ensures that your product badges are not only visually appealing but also highly effective in communicating your messages.": "Das Erstellen und Anpassen von Produktabzeichen ist mit unserer intuitiven Benutzeroberfläche ein Kinderspiel. ",
  "Seamless Integration with Your Store": "Nahtlose Integration in Ihren Shop",
  "Once created, product badges are seamlessly integrated into your storefront. They appear prominently on product images, ensuring that they capture the attention of your customers as they browse through your offerings. This seamless integration means that there is no disruption to the shopping experience; instead, it enhances it by providing clear, concise information at a glance. This not only aids in the decision-making process but also adds a professional touch to your product listings.": "Nach der Erstellung werden Produktabzeichen nahtlos in Ihre Storefront integriert. ",
  "Robust Backend Management": "Robustes Backend-Management",
  "Managing your product badges from the backend is both simple and efficient. The Product Badge Management module offers a comprehensive dashboard where you can easily add, edit, or remove badges as needed. This centralized management system allows you to keep your badges up-to-date and relevant to your current promotions and inventory status. Additionally, the module supports bulk actions, enabling you to apply badges to multiple products simultaneously, saving you time and effort.": "Die Verwaltung Ihrer Produktabzeichen über das Backend ist sowohl einfach als auch effizient. ",
  "Boosting Sales and Customer Engagement": "Steigerung von Umsatz und Kundenbindung",
